      "content": "I get what you're saying about heritage vs viral trends, but help me bridge the gap for my client. When we talk about these \"street-level\" trends like drill or AAVE-based slang, what kind of consumer profile are we looking at in terms of educational or socioeconomic background? \n\nLike, if a brand wants to avoid looking \"unrefined\" or \"low-tier,\" are there specific cultural markers or certain demographics they should avoid targeting to maintain a sense of prestige?",
